{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/JokeAward01.png?t=1742268491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aetherbound TD</strong> is a run-based <strong>tower defense roguelike</strong> where every decision shapes your survival. Choose from powerful towers and upgrades while adapting to escalating enemy threats\u2014but <strong>you're not the only one getting stronger. Enemies gain perks too... and</strong> <strong>you decide which ones they get!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>dozens of unique towers and enemy types</strong>, strategic tower placement, and limited space, every run presents a new challenge. How long can you hold out before your defenses collapse?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0 A New Take on Tower Defense Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/JokeAward03.png?t=1742268491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When enemies reach the end of the path, your tiles will go boom! Lose all of your tiles and the run comes to an end. If a tower was placed on a tile that is no longer with us, it will be recalled and cannot be placed again until a cooldown timer expires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you draft the perfect defense and survive against ever-growing enemy forces, or will your towers crumble under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/Wishlist.png?t=1742268491\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490400?t=1742268491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/3b3b2e27afae87da443a1e8d905eeee9a5f79a26/page_bg_raw.